# Circuit shape of `abs_checked` for each integer type, operand mode and edge value.
# Line: <type.mode of each operand> <value of each constant operand, _ for a variable one, or *> : <result>
# A `_` stands for each value of a variable operand. The test checks that they give one result.
# Result: constants public private constraints nonzeros(A/B/C) output-mode, or halt.
# A mixed output mode counts the constant, public and private bits.
# The test also checks each case with the console operation. A defined case must give the console
# value in a satisfied circuit. An undefined case must halt or leave the circuit unsatisfied.
# A `*` line gives the result of each case of its block that has no line of its own.
# Regenerate: UPDATE_CIRCUIT_SNAPSHOTS=1 cargo test -p snarkvm-circuit-types-integers --test snapshots
u8.constant * : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
u8.public _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 public
u8.private _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 private
u16.constant * : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
u16.public _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 public
u16.private _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 private
u32.constant * : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
u32.public _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 public
u32.private _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 private
u64.constant * : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
u64.public _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 public
u64.private _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 private
u128.constant * : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
u128.public _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 public
u128.private _ : 0 0 0 0 0/0/0 private
i8.constant * : 16 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
i8.constant MIN : halt
i8.public _ : 8 0 19 21 38/30/29 private
i8.private _ : 8 0 19 21 38/30/29 private
i16.constant * : 32 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
i16.constant MIN : halt
i16.public _ : 16 0 35 37 70/54/53 private
i16.private _ : 16 0 35 37 70/54/53 private
i32.constant * : 64 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
i32.constant MIN : halt
i32.public _ : 32 0 67 69 134/102/101 private
i32.private _ : 32 0 67 69 134/102/101 private
i64.constant * : 128 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
i64.constant MIN : halt
i64.public _ : 64 0 131 133 262/198/197 private
i64.private _ : 64 0 131 133 262/198/197 private
i128.constant * : 256 0 0 0 0/0/0 constant
i128.constant MIN : halt
i128.public _ : 128 0 259 261 518/390/389 private
i128.private _ : 128 0 259 261 518/390/389 private
